   <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_45af" name="**Following the successful transmission of data from the IP to the INQ, the reimbursement process within ERICS company is initiated, as the transaction data verification enables the system to receive and process the subsequent reimbursement request.**&#10;&#10;This transition sentence logically connects Process A and Process B by indicating that when the IP successfully transmits data (the positive outcome from Process A), it provides the necessary transaction verification that allows the ERICS reimbursement process (Process B) to begin with a received reimbursement request." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_Task_3" targetRef="Bridge_3_45af" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_45af" targetRef="atom_3_sid-6F22AD7F-6D68-4206-9609-9C64EDEB1088" /><bpmn:task id="atom_4_Activity_0973sxi" name="evaluate&#10;the&#10;Application">
