   <bpmn:task id="Bridge_6_f5f6" name="**Transition Sentence:**&#10;&#10;Once the Payment Office completes vendor payments and the Registry office archives all transaction records, employees can file corresponding expense reports for reimbursement, as the established financial documentation from Process A provides the necessary verification trail for Process B's expense approval workflow.&#10;&#10;**Alternatively (more concise):**&#10;&#10;After vendor payments are processed and archived, employees can submit expense reports, utilizing the same financial documentation system to trigger the reimbursement approval process.&#10;&#10;**简化的中文版本：**&#10;&#10;在供应商付款完成并归档后，员工可以提交费用报告，利用相同的财务文档系统触发报销审批流程。" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_6" sourceRef="atom_5_sid-B04A55A4-51B9-4576-9C84-2DD04CCD767C" targetRef="Bridge_6_f5f6" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_6" sourceRef="Bridge_6_f5f6" targetRef="atom_6_sid-8130C1AC-F735-4F22-8EB4-09A290306712" /></bpmn:process>
